<title>USA: Fred Meyer raised to outperform.</title>
<headline>Fred Meyer raised to outperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jensen Securities Co said it raised its rating on Fred Meyer Inc to outperform from underperform, saying it was well positioned to benefit from a strengthening regional economy.</p>
<p>Analyst Thomas J. Carley said that the regional economy &quot;should strengthen over the next several years as production and employment at Boeing increase.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/2 at 28-1/2.</p>
</text>
